5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm so excited to play! Let's all work together to find the werewolf!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep it calm. We have no information yet, so observation is the only logical step.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We should analyze the speech patterns and reactions of everyone here.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,A wise start. Let us treat this as a journey of discovery and trust.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,I'll do my best to help everyone! I hope we can all stay friends!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,Does anyone have a plan for how we should vote tomorrow?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,It's too early for a plan. We should wait and see if the Seer chooses to reveal themselves.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, revealing the Seer too early can be a risk. It depends on the result.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, Ryuji. Let us see what the first night brings us.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I'll just follow whatever the group decides!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
