31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone, listen! I'm the Seer, and I found the werewolf! Shion is the werewolf!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,That was fast. A Seer revealing themselves on day one is either very brave or a werewolf trying to frame me.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"This is a critical moment. If Kenji is the Seer, the game ends now. If he's lying, we lose a villager.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Such a bold claim so early. Shion, how do you respond to this accusation?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! Shion, is that true? I can't believe it!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm not lying! I checked Shion last night and it was clear!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,"It's a simple strategy. By claiming the Seer role, the werewolf can eliminate a target immediately. I am a human.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, why did you decide to reveal yourself immediately instead of waiting for more data?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,Perhaps the certainty of the result left him no choice but to speak.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I want to believe Kenji! He seems so honest!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I just wanted to save the village as quickly as possible!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Yumi, don't let your kindness blind you. Logic dictates we should be suspicious of such a sudden claim.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Shion's composure is typical, but Kenji's urgency is also a common trait of the Seer.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,"In my experience, the truth often arrives with a certain intensity. I am leaning toward Kenji.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Yumi,,See? Servas believes him too!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Please, let's vote for Shion!","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,This is a mistake you will regret once I am gone and the werewolf remains.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,The risk of keeping a confirmed werewolf is higher than the risk of a fake Seer. I'll vote Kenji's way.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,I agree. Let us trust the Seer's vision.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm voting for Shion!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
